From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:41:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] d/pimax_p3c: brightness, upscaling, restart and volume
 keys

- Live settings PIMAX_BRIGHTNESS (1-100), PIMAX_UPSCALE (0/1) and
  PIMAX_RESTART_AT (Unix ms; restarts once if newer than the session start),
  sent from the command loop when they change.
- The headset's volume keys change the default output volume through pactl
  on a worker thread (5 % steps, repeat while held, never raised past 100 %).
  PIMAX_VOLUME_KEYS=0 turns it off; apps still get the keys as inputs.
